1. SCOPE

This license applies only to the front end of the Murkio website and
console, as published in this repository (the "Software"). The Software
includes:

  (a) the source files: `.pierrot` pages and components, CSS, TypeScript,
      and the build configuration in `settings.json`;
  (b) the interface design: layout, visual style, themes, animations,
      and the way pages and components are composed;
  (c) the text and translations in `src/i18n` and any other copy;
  (d) the original assets in `src/assets`, including the Murkio logos,
      icons, illustrations, masks, and textures; and
  (e) the compiled output produced from the files above, such as the
      folder generated by `pierrot build`.

This license does NOT apply to, and grants no rights in, any other part of
the Murkio platform: the backend services (Identity, Vault, Messaging,
Payments, Lambda, and others), their APIs, the SDKs, the infrastructure
configuration, or the data processed by any of them. Each of those is
governed by its own terms. Access to the Software gives no right to use any
Murkio service; using a service requires accepting that service's own terms.

